## SQ-MT-04 | squid and glow squid flee a cachalot whale at 10 blocks, not at 30; an orca is not fled
@group B
@commands deep ocean: a squid and a glow squid (tagged), a cachalot whale `{NoAI:1b}` 30 blocks off; Pos at 0 s and 10 s; tp the whale 10 blocks from them, Pos at 0 s and 8 s; then the same with an orca `{NoAI:1b}` at 10 blocks
@pass at 30 both wander (no steady drift from the whale); after the tp both are farther from the whale by 8 s (about 14 blocks or more off); the orca at 10: no steady flight
@fails no flight: `SquidsAndWhales` not registered (Alex's Mobs check in `CreativeCompat`) or the goal not added on join; flight from the orca: the goal matches more than `EntityCachalotWhale`
@draft steps follow SQ-PSM-08's pattern (locate deep_ocean, forceload, summon, Pos captures, distance print); the first runner writes them here once
@reviewed 2026-11-24

## SQ-MT-05 | the giant squid does not flee a whale and attacks one within 12 blocks
@group B
@commands deep ocean: a giant squid and a cachalot whale `{NoAI:1b}` 30 blocks apart; Pos and the whale's Health at 0 s and 10 s; tp the whale 10 blocks from the squid; Pos and Health at 5 s and 20 s
@pass at 30 the squid neither flees nor closes in; after the tp it swims to the whale and the whale's Health drops (grab damage 3 to 7 a second); the boot log applies `AmGiantSquidAvoidWhalesMixin` with no error
@fails it swims away: the mixin did not apply (`m_8036_` in `EntityGiantSquid$AIAvoidWhales`); no attack: the target goal not added
@draft steps follow SQ-PSM-08's pattern; the first runner writes them here once
@reviewed 2026-11-24

## SQ-MT-06 | the giant squid fights back against a hunting whale; no [giant_squid] config
@group B
@commands deep ocean: a giant squid and a cachalot whale with AI 25 blocks apart (the whale hunts giant squid); watch 60 s (Pos, both Health every 10 s); grep `config/creativecompat-common.toml`
@pass the squid never moves away from the whale; once the whale hits it, it grabs the whale (the whale's Health drops); the config file has no `[giant_squid]` table
@fails the squid flees: SQ-MT-05 fails too; a `[giant_squid]` table: an old config copied in (Forge drops the unknown table on the next write)
@draft the whale only hunts when hungry and not sleeping (Alex's Mobs); the first runner sets the steps and the wait
@reviewed 2026-11-24
